vLLM -- https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm
Apache Licence 2.0
================================================================================

This is a vLLM plugin: it imports vLLM's interfaces and subclasses them. No vLLM
source is copied into this repository. Two places follow vLLM's structure
closely enough to be worth naming:

  vllm_exl3/attention.py   subclasses SparseMLACommonImpl and reuses
                           FlashInferMLASparseMetadataBuilder unchanged; the
                           forward_mqa contract follows
                           vllm/v1/attention/backends/mla/flashinfer_mla_sparse_sm120.py
  vllm_exl3/moe.py         follows vLLM's fused-MoE weight-loading protocol

The full Apache 2.0 licence text is at https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

